{"src":"en","tgt":"fr","rate":24000,"room_opened_ms_before":1500,"err":"","clip_ms":165700,"events":[{"kind":"hello","type":"hello","lang":"fr","src":"en","rate":24000,"mode":"utterance","edition":"commercial","context":true},{"kind":"input","t":3882.236039,"text":"It is thinner under the"},{"kind":"text","t":4020.1201560000004,"text":"C'est plus mince sous le"},{"kind":"audio","t":4069.736056,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":380,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":4072.28504,"samples":11032,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":120},{"kind":"input","t":7391.229389,"text":"Maria and thicker under the highlands."},{"kind":"text","t":7600.7120859999995,"text":"Maria et plus épais sous les hauts plateaux."},{"kind":"audio","t":7650.210168,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":390,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":7654.337169999999,"samples":31432,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":920},{"kind":"input","t":14647.46381,"text":"During this period of European history, the Catholic Church, which had become rich and powerful,"},{"kind":"text","t":15051.650442999999,"text":"Durant cette période de l'histoire européenne, l'Église catholique, qui était devenue riche et puissante,"},{"kind":"audio","t":15104.489988000001,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":390,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":15106.50821,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1290},{"kind":"audio","t":15108.384882999999,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":90,"off":1150},{"kind":"audio","t":15110.652211,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":15111.275452999998,"samples":17728,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":370},{"kind":"input","t":17774.139729,"text":"came under scrutiny."},{"kind":"text","t":17914.744147,"text":"a été remise en question."},{"kind":"audio","t":17961.269671,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":380,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":17961.907651999998,"samples":15232,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":270},{"kind":"input","t":24263.329382,"text":"Also to the north, visit the Great Sanctuary of Our Lady of Fatima Shrine, a place of worldwide"},{"kind":"text","t":24733.11827,"text":"Rendez-vous également au nord pour visiter le Grand Sanctuaire de Notre-Dame de Fatima, un lieu de renommée mondiale"},{"kind":"audio","t":24780.377094,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":400,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":24785.66317,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":24790.996514,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":24796.214201,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":24801.610675,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1250},{"kind":"audio","t":24801.907041,"samples":5960,"rate":24000},{"kind":"input","t":31551.208998,"text":"According to Japan's nuclear agency, radioactive casein and iodine has been identified at the plant."},{"kind":"text","t":32070.622355999996,"text":"Selon l'agence nucléaire du Japon, de la caséine radioactive et de l'iode ont été identifiés dans l'usine."},{"kind":"audio","t":32116.764626,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":380,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":32118.582809999996,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":32120.631781,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":32122.590313999997,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":32124.524057,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1200},{"kind":"audio","t":32124.785852999998,"samples":5360,"rate":24000},{"kind":"input","t":40590.697994,"text":"The document, according to the leak, will refer to the borders dispute, which Palestine wants based on the borders before the 1967 Mideast War."},{"kind":"text","t":41303.362959000006,"text":"Le document, selon la fuite, fera référence au différend frontalier, que la Palestine souhaite baser sur les frontières antérieures à la guerre du Moyen-Orient de 1967."},{"kind":"audio","t":41367.280948,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":390,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":41372.419585,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":41377.79125,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":41382.987946,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":41388.223152000006,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":41393.567777000004,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":41399.025550000006,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":41402.180116,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1130},{"kind":"audio","t":41402.318554000005,"samples":3056,"rate":24000},{"kind":"input","t":46935.250565,"text":"The capital of Moldova is Chisinau. The local language is Romanian but Russian."},{"kind":"text","t":47181.008872000006,"text":"La capitale de la Moldavie est Chisinau. La langue locale est le roumain mais le russe."},{"kind":"audio","t":47233.578211,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":400,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":47238.244655,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":980},{"kind":"audio","t":47238.543141,"samples":464,"rate":24000},{"kind":"audio","t":47283.410988,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":400,"off":1350},{"kind":"audio","t":47286.569664,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":120,"off":1230},{"kind":"audio","t":47286.840840000004,"samples":5264,"rate":24000},{"kind":"input","t":56069.655084000005,"text":"The other nominations include Best Picture, Director of Cinematography, Costume Design, Film Editing, Original Score,"},{"kind":"text","t":56479.611175000005,"text":"Les autres nominations incluent Meilleur film, Directeur de la photographie, Costumes, Montage, Musique originale,"},{"kind":"audio","t":56541.472583,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":400,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":56546.939766,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":56552.003255,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":56557.30277,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":56562.612695,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":56563.98196600001,"samples":14960,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":240},{"kind":"input","t":61327.312805,"text":"production design, sound editing, sound mixing, and original screenplay."},{"kind":"text","t":61652.346224,"text":"la direction artistique, le montage son, le mixage son et le scénario original."},{"kind":"audio","t":61709.534218,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":400,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":61714.624136000006,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":61719.98996100001,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":61725.331655,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1170},{"kind":"audio","t":61725.622581,"samples":4528,"rate":24000},{"kind":"input","t":67561.266666,"text":"Prior to the arrival of troops, Haiti had not encountered problems related to the disease since the 18th century."},{"kind":"text","t":68028.90301499999,"text":"Avant l'arrivée des troupes, Haïti n'avait pas rencontré de problèmes liés à la maladie depuis le XVIIIe siècle."},{"kind":"audio","t":68076.310206,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":390,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":68081.682911,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":68087.079445,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":68092.489648,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":68096.148427,"samples":27328,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":760},{"kind":"input","t":75355.131349,"text":"With two years of the end of the war, the former allies were now enemies and the Cold War began."},{"kind":"text","t":75778.353044,"text":"À deux ans de la fin de la guerre, les anciens alliés étaient désormais ennemis et la guerre froide commença."},{"kind":"audio","t":75824.94136699999,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":400,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":75830.10633499999,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":75835.32969099999,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":75840.585827,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":75843.486246,"samples":23128,"rate":24000,"on":50,"off":560},{"kind":"input","t":85374.718971,"text":"In fact, it is not easy to find at all even if one knew it existed once inside the cave it is a total isolation"},{"kind":"text","t":86116.72134199999,"text":"En fait, ce n'est pas facile du tout à trouver, même si l'on savait que cela a existé autrefois ; à l'intérieur de la grotte, c'est un isolement total."},{"kind":"audio","t":86161.502951,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":400,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":86166.901014,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1290},{"kind":"audio","t":86172.21346,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":180,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":86177.58891399999,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1320},{"kind":"audio","t":86178.05685699999,"samples":8728,"rate":24000},{"kind":"audio","t":86211.735093,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":400,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":86217.110307,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":86219.962197,"samples":22664,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":560},{"kind":"input","t":98256.13393299999,"text":"Unfortunately, stunning traffic flow is difficult because driver behavior cannot be predicted with 100% certainty."},{"kind":"text","t":98828.767242,"text":"Malheureusement, un flux de circulation fluide est difficile à obtenir car le comportement des conducteurs ne peut être prédit avec une certitude de 100 %."},{"kind":"audio","t":98887.955218,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":390,"off":1130},{"kind":"audio","t":98889.501156,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":98891.063654,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":98892.656601,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":98894.1877,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":98895.816167,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":98897.11952899999,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1000},{"kind":"audio","t":98897.344725,"samples":1024,"rate":24000},{"kind":"input","t":108597.587158,"text":"In 2002, Goma was destroyed by lava from the Nyirangogo volcano, which buried most of the town's streets, particularly the town of Goma."},{"kind":"text","t":109345.278209,"text":"En 2002, Goma a été détruite par la lave du volcan Nyiragongo, qui a enseveli la plupart des rues de la ville, particulièrement la ville de Goma."},{"kind":"audio","t":109438.01226199999,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":400,"off":1230},{"kind":"audio","t":109443.270758,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":70,"off":1310},{"kind":"audio","t":109448.57582299999,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":109453.804679,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":109459.194343,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":109464.49736899999,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":200,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":109466.29568299999,"samples":17592,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":330},{"kind":"input","t":114620.777829,"text":"Rolando Mendoza fired his M16 rifle at the terrorist."},{"kind":"text","t":114949.851551,"text":"Rolando Mendoza a tiré avec son fusil M16 sur le terroriste."},{"kind":"audio","t":114992.58166899999,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":400,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":114998.063661,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":115003.385126,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":115004.35590299999,"samples":13296,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":160},{"kind":"input","t":123389.913256,"text":"If you're not used to driving on country roads, keep your wits about you. Steep grades, narrow lanes, and sharp curves predominate."},{"kind":"text","t":123787.844697,"text":"Si vous n'avez pas l'habitude de conduire sur des routes de campagne, restez vigilant. Les pentes raides, les voies étroites et les virages serrés prédominent."},{"kind":"audio","t":123842.82739199999,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":380,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":123848.38980399999,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":123853.46094199999,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":123856.47395,"samples":23496,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":580},{"kind":"audio","t":123919.38599299999,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":400,"off":1300},{"kind":"audio","t":123924.845666,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":110,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":123930.159071,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1230},{"kind":"audio","t":123930.346278,"samples":5496,"rate":24000},{"kind":"input","t":132533.876189,"text":"Most modern research telescopes are enormous facilities in remote areas with favorable atmospheric conditions."},{"kind":"text","t":133055.160022,"text":"La plupart des télescopes de recherche modernes sont des installations énormes situées dans des zones reculées offrant des conditions atmosphériques favorables."},{"kind":"audio","t":133116.03767400002,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":400,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":133121.40660800002,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":133126.68193400002,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":133131.984889,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":133137.22815500002,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1300},{"kind":"audio","t":133142.58238,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":90,"off":1350},{"kind":"audio","t":133147.854705,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":10,"off":1280},{"kind":"audio","t":133148.009003,"samples":7624,"rate":24000},{"kind":"input","t":138531.22945500002,"text":"The cabbage juice changes color depending on how acidic, basic, alkaline the chemical is."},{"kind":"text","t":138925.35693,"text":"Le jus de chou change de couleur selon que le produit chimique est acide, basique ou alcalin."},{"kind":"audio","t":138990.694839,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":400,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":138996.080603,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":139001.37697800001,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":139006.49968600002,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1350},{"kind":"audio","t":139006.734743,"samples":9328,"rate":24000},{"kind":"input","t":145366.620639,"text":"This offers a good opportunity to see the Aurora Borealis as the sky will be dark more or less around the time."},{"kind":"text","t":145896.395751,"text":"C'est une bonne occasion d'observer l'aurore boréale, car le ciel sera sombre plus ou moins à ce moment-là."},{"kind":"audio","t":145952.205655,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":380,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":145957.459921,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":145962.864724,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":145970.461557,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":145974.754437,"samples":30928,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":870},{"kind":"input","t":151616.774991,"text":"So it is likely that the notation was added simply as a label."},{"kind":"text","t":151911.21605100002,"text":"Il est donc probable que la notation ait été ajoutée simplement comme étiquette."},{"kind":"audio","t":151954.689668,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":400,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":151960.125571,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":151967.966541,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":151970.93817900002,"samples":24696,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":670},{"kind":"input","t":158536.418307,"text":"Parisians have a reputation for being egocentric, rude, and arrogant."},{"kind":"text","t":158892.87977200001,"text":"Les Parisiens ont la réputation d'être égocentriques, impolis et arrogants."},{"kind":"audio","t":158936.80398300002,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":400,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":158941.99185000002,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":158947.20637700002,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":158949.00132100002,"samples":16896,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":320},{"kind":"input","t":164531.09758,"text":"A curry is a dish based on herbs and spices together with either meat or vegetables."},{"kind":"text","t":164947.930505,"text":"Un curry est un plat à base d'herbes et d'épices, accompagné de viande ou de légumes."},{"kind":"audio","t":164992.35393900002,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":400,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":164997.595015,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":165002.90811000002,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":165006.682787,"samples":27096,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":740},{"kind":"close","t":175804.64095600002,"code":1005}]}